From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:48:58 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 51/52] Meridian: extensions from Arc
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Meridian reads which Web Store extensions Arc has (each profile's Extensions
folder: names from the manifests, themes and unpacked ones left out) and lists
them in Settings > Get started with Add…, which opens the extension's Web
Store page; added ones show as Added. The Site Control Center says how many
are left to add. Nothing is installed without the person.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
